                                                  rdfs:comment "Automated change 2026-02-26: GO:0006535 replaced by GO:0019344" ,
                                                               "It might not be obvious why there are 2 instances of dia4 in htis model, but this is because there are 2 copies needed in the modification model, which this merges with (because this model has different upstream pathways for different tRNAs)" ,
