""" ,
                                                               """see https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/28833 foir an explanation of the alternative cysteine synthase specificity/inputs
""" ;
                                                  <https://w3id.org/biolink/vocab/in_taxon> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_4896> .

